OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman found dead with stab injuries
OL,6,FA man in his 30s has died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed in Sutton Coldfield.
OL,9,FWest Midlands Police were called to
OL,10,FChester Road shortly after midnight on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,13,FThe man was found with stab wounds and
OL,14,Fhe died at the scene.
OL,16,FA man in his 20s was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of murder and remains in
OL,18,Fpolice custody while investigations
OL,19,Fcontinue.
