OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786198692
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman found dead with stab injuries
OL,6,FPolice are not currently looking for
OL,7,Fanyone else in connection with this
OL,8,Fincident and it is thought the suspect
OL,9,Fand victim were known to each other.
OL,11,FOfficers are remaining at the scene
OL,12,Ftoday to investigate and gather
OL,13,Fevidence.
OL,15,FPolice are keen to hear from anyone
OL,16,Fwho was in the area at the time of the
OL,17,Fincident and might know more about
OL,18,Fwhat happened.
